      \item{\code{dry_run}}{A logical that is \code{TRUE} to report what would be cancelled and closed without sending anything.}
      \item{\code{timeout_seconds}}{The numeric number of seconds to wait for UBI's answer, which takes one wait for the cancellations and one for the closed positions to show zero.}
